[quote][b]I'm working on all of these mods on my own.[/b] If you'd like to help, extend or fix one of them, co-author a new one, or join one of my bigger projects, I'm very open to it. Send me a message here on Nexus or on the [b]FarCry:Modding Discord Server[/b].[/quote]

Far Cry 2 seen from outside when you want it: over your shoulder on foot, behind the car at the wheel. And in first person, your own legs under you and a shadow at your feet.

[b][size=4]What it adds[/size][/b]
[list]
[*][b]Its own control[/b] - Third-person view, on [b]V[/b] by default and rebindable in Options > Controls, under Misc. It switches between first and third person, on foot and at the wheel.[/*]
[*][b]Over the shoulder on foot[/b] - your whole body with the game's own animations, the game's own crosshair, and your shots landing on it. Hold aim and the camera comes closer and the crosshair tightens. You carry your gun low until you aim or fire.[/*]
[*][b]A chase camera at the wheel[/b] - behind the car, swinging after it with a lag so you see the body work on its suspension. The mouse orbits it. You see yourself driving.[/*]
[*][b]A camera that keeps out of walls[/b] - it pulls in quickly where the ground, a wall or a rock comes between you, and eases back out once the way is clear.[/*]
[*][b]Your legs in first person[/b] - look down and you see your legs and boots, striding as you walk and crouching with you.[/*]
[*][b]A soft shadow under your feet[/b] in first person, where the game casts none.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Settings[/b][/size]
In [b]Options → Mod Configuration Menu[/b]:
[list]
[*][b]Legs in first person[/b]: on by default.[/*]
[*][b]Shadow in first person[/b]: on by default. It needs the game's depth pass, which DepthPassQuality high or above draws.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]How to install (Vortex)[/b][/size]

[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/about/vortex/]Vortex[/url] and its Far Cry 2 extension.[/*]
[*]Click [b]Mod Manager Download[/b] on this page and enable the mod. Vortex also offers to get [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/farcry2/mods/368]FCSE[/url], which this mod needs.[/*]
[*]Start the game with the [b]Play[/b] button in Vortex.[/*]
[/list]
Not using Vortex? Install it with JackAll instead, [url=https://jbebe.github.io/farcry-sdk/jackall/installing-mods/]here's a detailed instruction[/url] for JackAll installation.

[size=4][b]Good to know[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Needs Far Cry 2 patch 1.03[/b], Steam or GOG, and FCSE 1.4.0 or later.[/*]
[*][b]Vehicle Overhaul 1.0.1 and earlier[/b] have a third-person view of their own on V. Use a later Vehicle Overhaul, which leaves the view to this mod.[/*]
[*][b]Works with other mods that add keys.[/b][/*]
[*][b]Known limits[/b]: moving crouched in third person plays the standing legs, since the game has no crouch-walk animation; there is no third-person jump; getting in or out of a car shows first person.[/*]
[/list]
